  "text": "## Charter  \n### 1. Committee Composition  \n**Members:**\n- Independent Non-Executive Director (Chair)\n- 2–3 Independent Non-Executive Directors\n- Chief Risk Officer (executive, non-voting in deliberations)\n- Chief Financial Officer (executive, non-voting in deliberations)  \n**Minimum Independence:**\n- Majority of members must be independent (per FCA/PRA definition)\n- Chair must be independent\n- No executive directors as voting members (except as observers)  \n**Committee Secretary:**\n- Appointed by Board\n- Provides administrative support\n- Maintains records, meeting minutes",
  "name": "Chunk 3/14",
